# data/interim/*.parquet IS committed on purpose: it's the already-filtered
# (Aarhus-only, ~38MB) Phase 0 fixture that lets CI run `dbt run`/`dbt test`
# and the eval set reproducibly, without needing the 590MB/day national raw
# files or network access to the Danish Maritime Authority. See
# .github/workflows/ci.yml and domain/08-phases.md, Phase 5.

